  description: "Discard 1 card, and if you do, Special Summon as many \"Dual Avatar
    Spirit Tokens\" as possible (Warrior/LIGHT/Level 2/ATK 0/DEF 0), also for the
    rest of this turn you cannot Special Summon monsters from the Extra Deck, except
    Fusion Monsters, and all Tokens you control cannot be Tributed and are destroyed
    during the End Phase. After Summoning these Token(s), you can apply this effect
    up to twice.\r\n\u25CF Fusion Summon 1 \"Dual Avatar\" Fusion Monster from your
    Extra Deck, using monsters from your hand or field as Fusion Material.\r\nYou
    can only activate 1 \"Dual Avatar Invitation\" per turn."
